ction class=\"relative min-h-[60vh] flex items-center overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0\"><img alt=\"Shenzhen dünya ticaret merkezi - Çin&#x27;den ABD&#x27;ye ithalat\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/images/trade-center.jpg\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-black/55 via-black/35 to-black/15\"></div></div><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-32\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 hover:bg-primary/80 mb-4 bg-black/40 border-teal-400/40 text-teal-300 text-sm px-4 py-1\">Çin&#x27;den ABD&#x27;ye ithalat için bilmeniz gereken her şey</div><h1 class=\"font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-tight mb-6 text-white\">ABD İthalat Rehberi</h1><p class=\"text-lg sm:text-xl text-white/90 leading-relaxed mb-8\">ABD gümrük kuralları, tarifeler, vergi ve ithalat süreçleri hakkında kapsamlı rehber.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4\"><a href=\"/#contact\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap font-medium transition-all duration-fast focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background active:scale-[0.98] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:w-4 [&amp;_svg]:h-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-primary hover:bg-primary/90 h-11 rounded-lg px-6 text-base bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 to-teal-400 text-white border-0 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl gap-2\">Ücretsiz Danışmanlık<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button></a><a href=\"/faydali-bilgiler\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap font-medium transition-all duration-fast focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background active:scale-[0.98] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:w-4 [&amp;_svg]:h-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 border shadow-sm hover:text-accent-foreground hover:shadow-sm h-11 rounded-lg px-6 gap-2 text-sm text-white border-white/40 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm hover:bg-white/20 hover:border-white/60\">Faydalı Bilgiler</button></a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 sm:py-28\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"grid gap-8\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500/10 to-teal-400/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check w-6 h-6 text-blue-600\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl\">ABD Gümrük Kuralları</h3></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 flex-shrink-0\"></span><span class=\"text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed\">ABD&#x27;ye ithalat yapmak için özel bir lisans gerekmiyor, ancak tüm ithalatçıların bir IRS numarası olmalı</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 flex-shrink-0\"></span><span class=\"text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed\">Her ürünün HTS (Harmonized Tariff Schedule) koduna göre sınıflandırılması gerekiyor</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 flex-shrink-0\"></span><span class=\"text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed\">Gümrük bedeli ürünün CIF değeri (maliyet + sigorta + nakliye) üzerinden hesaplanıyor</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 flex-shrink-0\"></span><span class=\"text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed\">Kargo değeri $800&#x27;in altında olanlar Mini Summits muafiyetinden yararlanabilir (değişebilir)</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 flex-shrink-0\"></span><span class=\"text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed\">Tüm belgelerin doğru ve eksiksiz olması gerekiyor — hatalı beyan gecikmelere ve cezalara yol açar</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500/10 to-teal-400/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text w-6 h-6 text-blue-600\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl\">Tarifeler ve Vergiler</h3></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 flex-shrink-0\"></span><span class=\"text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed\">Çin&#x27;den gelen ürünlere ek tarifeler uygulanıyor (Section 301) — %7.5 ile %25 arası değişiyor</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 flex-shrink-0\"></span><span class=\"text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed\">Her ürünün HTS kodunu öğrenmek için CBP Interactive Tariff Database kullanabilirsiniz</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 flex-shrink-0\"></span><span class=\"text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed\">Gümrük vergisi ürünün CIF değeri üzerinden hesaplanıyor</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 flex-shrink-0\"></span><span class=\"text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed\">Bazı ürürlere ek güvenlik tarifeleri (antidumping) uygulanabilir</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 flex-shrink-0\"></span><span class=\"text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed\">Tarifeler sürekli değişiyor — güncel listeyi CBP web sitesinden takip edin</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500/10 to-teal-400/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-truck w-6 h-6 text-blue-600\"><path d=\"M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2\"></path><path d=\"M15 18H9\"></path><path d=\"M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl\">İthalat Süreci Adımları</h3></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 flex-shrink-0\"></span><span class=\"text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed\">1. Ürünü ve HTS kodunu belirle — doğru kod doğru vergi demek</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 flex-shrink-0\"></span><span class=\"text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed\">2. Tedarikçi bul ve numune iste — kalite kontrolü ihaleden önce yap</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 flex-shrink-0\"></span><span class=\"text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed\">3. Fiyat ve şartları netleştir — FOB, CIF gibi Incoterms&#x27;ı belirle</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 flex-shrink-0\"></span><span class=\"text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed\">4. Nakliye düzenle — deniz (hazne) veya hava (hızlı) seçenekleri</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 flex-shrink-0\"></span><span class=\"text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed\">5. Gümrük beyanı — ISF (Importer Security Filing) 24 saat önceden yapılmalı</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 flex-shrink-0\"></span><span class=\"text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed\">6. Gümrük kontrolü ve vergi ödeme — CBP inceler, vergini öde</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 flex-shrink-0\"></span><span class=\"text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed\">7. Ürün serbest bırakılır — depoya veya FBA warehouse&#x27;e teslim</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"relative py-24 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0\"><img alt=\"Satış mağazalarını yerinde ziyaret - ABD pazarı ürün analizi\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/images/retail-visit.jpg\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-900/60 via-blue-900/45 to-teal-800/35\"></div></div><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"max-w-2xl text-white\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/15 backdrop-blur-sm text-white text-sm font-medium mb-4 border border-white/20\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-store w-4 h-4\"><path d=\"m2 7 4.41-4.41A2 2 0 0 1 7.83 2h8.34a2 2 0 0 1 1.42.59L22 7\"></path><path d=\"M4 12v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-8\"></path><path d=\"M15 22v-4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M2 7h20\"></path><path d=\"M22 7v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2a2.7 2.7 0 0 1-1.59-.63.7.7 0 0 0-.82 0A2.7 2.7 0 0 1 16 12a2.7 2.7 0 0 1-1.59-.63.7.7 0 0 0-.82 0A2.7 2.7 0 0 1 12 12a2.7 2.7 0 0 1-1.59-.63.7.7 0 0 0-.82 0A2.7 2.7 0 0 1 8 12a2.7 2.7 0 0 1-1.59-.63.7.7 0 0 0-.82 0A2.7 2.7 0 0 1 4 12a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V7\"></path></svg>Yerinde Pazar Zekâsı</div><h2 class=\"font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-4\">Ürün Seçimini Şansa Bırakmıyoruz</h2><p class=\"text-white/90 text-lg leading-relaxed\">ABD pazarındaki perakende mağazalarını yerinde ziyaret ediyor, raf ürünlerini ve fiyatlandırmayı analiz ediyoruz. Tedarik kararlarını gerçek pazar verisiyle veriyoruz.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 sm:py-28\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"grid gap-8\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500/10 to-teal-400/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lightbulb w-6 h-6 text-blue-600\"><path d=\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"></path><path d=\"M9 18h6\"></path><path d=\"M10 22h4\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl\">İthalat İpuçları</h3></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 flex-shrink-0\"></span><span class=\"text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed\">Her zaman HTS kodunu kontrol et — yanlış kod ceza demek</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 flex-shrink-0\"></span><span class=\"text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed\">Numune mutlaka al — kalite kontrolü ihaleden önce yap</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 flex-shrink-0\"></span><span class=\"text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed\">Gümrük komisyoncusu (customs broker) tut — profesyonel destek önemli</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 flex-shrink-0\"></span><span class=\"text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed\">ASEAN ülkelerinden alternatif tedarikçi ara — tarifeler düşük olabilir</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 flex-shrink-0\"></span><span class=\"text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed\">Amazon FBA için doğru barkod ve etiketleme şart</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 flex-shrink-0\"></span><span class=\"text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed\">Sigorta yaptır — nakliye sırasında hasar riskine karşı</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 flex-shrink-0\"></span><span class=\"text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed\">Gümrük iadesi (drawback) fırsatlarını ara — vergi iade edilebilir</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 flex-shrink-0\"></span><span class=\"text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed\">Her yıl tarifeleri güncelle — Çin-ABD ticaret sürekli değişiyor</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500/10 to-teal-400/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-package w-6 h-6 text-blue-600\"><path d=\"m7.5 4.27 9 5.15\"></path><path d=\"M21 8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16Z\"></path><path d=\"m3.3 7 8.7 5 8.7-5\"></path><path d=\"M12 22V12\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl\">Eyalet Vergileri ve Dağıtım</h3></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 flex-shrink-0\"></span><span class=\"text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed\">ABD&#x27;de federal gümrük vergisi eyaletten bağımsız — tek tip</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 flex-shrink-0\"></span><span class=\"text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed\">Ancak satış vergisi (sales tax) eyalete göre değişiyor — bazı eyaletlerde muaf</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 flex-shrink-0\"></span><span class=\"text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed\">Dağıtım için FBA (Amazon FBA), 3PL veya kendi depo kombinasyonu</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 flex-shrink-0\"></span><span class=\"text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed\">E-ticaret için çoklu kanal stratejisi önerilir</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 flex-shrink-0\"></span><span class=\"text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed\">Dropshipping veya wholesale — iki farklı model, farklı vergi sonuçları</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-16 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 to-teal-400 text-white\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center\"><h2 class=\"font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold mb-4\">İthalat Projenizi Başlatmaya Hazır mısınız?</h2><p class=\"text-white/90 text-lg mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Uzman ekibimizle iletişime geçin ve Çin&#x27;den ithalat sürecinizi hemen başlatın.</p><a href=\"/#contact\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-3 bg-white text-blue-600 font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-white/90 transition-colors shadow-lg\">Bize Ulaşın</a></div></section><footer class=\"bg-card border-t py-12\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><a href=\"/\" class=\"flex items-center gap-3 group\"><img src=\"/cindenalsat-logo.jpg\" alt=\"Çin&#x27;den Al Sat Logo\" class=\"h-14 w-auto rounded-full ring-1 ring-border shadow-sm\"/><div><p class=\"font-display font-bold\">Çin&#x27;den Al Sat</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Çin ithalatında güvenilir danışmanlık ortağınız.</p></div></a></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><a class=\"p-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-muted transition-colors\" aria-label=\"Faydalı Bilgiler\" href=\"/faydali-bilgiler/\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open w-4 h-4\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0